V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4CeClosedChoice}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}c.e.\\text{-}closed\\text{-}choice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4CeClosedChoice}_S(X,C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nX=\\omega^\\omega\n\\land\n\\exists D\\;\n\\Biggl[\nD=\\left\\{A\\subseteq X:\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4EffectivelyClosedSet}_S(A)\n\\land A\\neq\\varnothing\n\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nC\\subseteq D\\times X\n\\land\n\\forall A\\in D\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\left(\\langle A,x\\rangle\\in C\\leftrightarrow x\\in A\\right)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}c.e.\\text{-}closed\\text{-}choice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4CeClosedChoice}_S(X,C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nX=\\omega^\\omega\n\\land\n\\exists D\\;\n\\Biggl[\nD=\\left\\{A\\subseteq X:\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4EffectivelyClosedSet}_S(A)\n\\land A\\neq\\varnothing\n\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nC\\subseteq D\\times X\n\\land\n\\forall A\\in D\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\left(\\langle A,x\\rangle\\in C\\leftrightarrow x\\in A\\right)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The available effective-closed-set predicate is for Baire space, so this\natom states that supported version explicitly.  The relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> contains\nexactly all admissible input/output pairs.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","statu